@ChristoSilvia @BostonGlobe Absolutely. We need faster public transit that goes more places.

But if public transit becomes awesome and attracts 2x the people, the roads will move more easily. And more people will say: hey! I can live in Littleton and commute to Boston!

You have to price scarce things.

